<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-σπασμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wheeling round</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.23.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				12.18.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>distracting circumstances, distraction</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				831.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.87.9
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.98K.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.831f
			</span></i> (pl.) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν περισπασμοῖς εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.32.5
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τῆς πόλεως π. καὶ φόβοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					12.38
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισπασμοὶ καὶ πιθανότητες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					3.77
				</span></i>
			 : rarely in sg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμοῦ π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ec.</u>
				2.23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.22.71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>circumflex accent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				34.24
			</span></i>.</div>
